ellow  These changes extend within 2 0cm of the deep margin  The breast parenchyma in this region demonstrates patchy dense  white bands with cysts  some of which are multiloculated  The axillary lymph nodes are pink  unremarkable  and up to 2 0cm in greatest dimension  Section code  A  section of nipple B  deep margin C and D cystic brown lesion E and F adjacent indurated parenchyma with brown discoloration G and H sections of firm  white bands with multiloculated cysts I  section of parenchyma away from lesion site J K L  lymph nodes Labeled  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm mastectomy specimen with overlying REMOVED_DATE x 11 0cm skin ellipse containing a 1 4cm nipple with central  brown irregularity  The subareolar parenchyma has a prominent fibrous component with scattered small nodules  some filled with green substance  Scattered enlargened ducts and filled with yellow soft substance are noted  Sections of nipple in M  of subareolar tissue in N U  and distant tissue in V  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  Danielle M Saunders  M D  PART A  LEFT MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  RIGHT SIMPLE MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
