ue of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  26 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 16 10 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm piece of breast  inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm stellate  white  firm mass abutting the inked surface  A representative section of the mass is frozen as frozen section  1  and saved frozen  The remainder of the nodule is submitted entirely in A through C  with representative sections of the rest of the remaining tissue are in D through J  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FXDX  1  RIGHT BREAST   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  FANG FANG  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
